{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/b1b902da3585a65c238519d055be6aeb.poster.avif?t=1756402452\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/b1b902da3585a65c238519d055be6aeb.webm?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/b1b902da3585a65c238519d055be6aeb.mp4?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shadow Lotus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mature Open-World Ninja RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of Edo-era Japan in <strong>Shadow Lotus</strong>, a mature open-world RPG that blends the art of stealth, seduction, and steel. Explore a vast, fully realized 3D environment inspired by feudal Japan\u2014lush bamboo forests, bustling Edo marketplaces, snow\u2011capped mountains, and hidden temples filled with secrets and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rogue shinobi cast out from your clan, you must navigate a treacherous world of power, pleasure, and betrayal. Every choice you make shapes not only your destiny\u2014but the fate of the empire itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/4f6c4db28a8a165f87725ff16c069e7b.poster.avif?t=1756402452\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/4f6c4db28a8a165f87725ff16c069e7b.webm?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/4f6c4db28a8a165f87725ff16c069e7b.mp4?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Seduce the Princesses of Edo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will encounter a cast of <strong>beautiful Japanese princesses</strong> and noblewomen, each with her own personality, desires, and hidden agendas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady Akemi</strong> \u2013 A widowed noblewoman hiding in the village; seeks justice for her murdered husband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Princess Kayo</strong> \u2013 A sharp-tongued innkeeper who provides information and refuge to Ichiro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady Miyu</strong> \u2013 A shrine maiden who tends the village shrine, protecting spiritual balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Princess Yuriko</strong> \u2013 Daughter of the village merchant, ambitious and cunning, caught between rival gangs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady Aiko</strong> \u2013 A skilled herbalist who provides medicines, but whose past dealings with yakuza endanger her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady Chiyo</strong> \u2013 A quiet seamstress who secretly spies for one gang, torn by loyalty and guilt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win their trust, unravel their secrets, and unlock <strong>high\u2011resolution, fully animated mature encounters</strong> designed to be as alluring as they are immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/89811e1c9c0edba31998c9f44a25108b.poster.avif?t=1756402452\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/89811e1c9c0edba31998c9f44a25108b.webm?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/89811e1c9c0edba31998c9f44a25108b.mp4?t=1756402452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Thrilling Ninja Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Shadow Lotus</strong> blends fast\u2011paced RPG action with tactical stealth:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>art of the katana</strong>, from lightning\u2011fast strikes to precise counters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stealth and parkour</strong> to infiltrate enemy fortresses, slip unseen through moonlit courtyards, or eliminate targets from the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock devastating <strong>Lotus Techniques</strong>\u2014forbidden shinobi arts fueled by blood, passion, and shadow.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0f <strong>A Fully Explorable Edo\u2011Era World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam bustling <strong>Edo marketplaces</strong>, complete with vendors, entertainers, and underground gambling dens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>bamboo forests, misty mountains, and coastal villages</strong>, each filled with quests, challenges, and hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate <strong>daimyo castles, brothels, shrines, and secret ninja compounds</strong>, each designed with breathtaking attention to historical detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path: side with warring clans, carve your own legend, or betray them all in pursuit of power and desire.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature, <strong>high\u2011resolution 3D lewd animations</strong> integrated into the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living Edo\u2011era Japan with branching quests, dynamic NPCs, and moral choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep combat system blending action RPG mechanics and stealth assassination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance, seduction, and intrigue with <strong>multiple princesses and courtesans</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, sensual storyline where every choice has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Lotus</strong> invites you into a world where honor is a mask, shadows conceal forbidden pleasures, and your blade is not the only weapon at your disposal.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873980?t=1756402452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/1fb2e2b9af3242f7188412151968b4d6c5e8e5b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756402452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/110d3989aaf760a5708ac3ccfee48ef377f92600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756402452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/110d3989aaf760a5708ac3ccfee48ef377f92600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756402452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is intended for adults (18+) only and includes:\r\n\u2022 explicit and frequent nudity\r\n\u2022 sexual dialog and scenes/scenarios\r\n\u2022 oral, vaginal, anal penetrative and non-penetrative acts\r\n\u2022 some references extreme violence\r\n\u2022 Female Penetration, Ejaculation, Full Nudity\r\n\u2022 All characters depicted are over the age of 18.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873980/extras/b1b902da3585a65c238519d055be6aeb.poster.avif?t=1756402452\" width=602 height=216